up the patients in their Hong Kong hotels and transporting them in private.
Likewise, digital money and similar crypto schemes could be used to
circumvent stodgy and Judaeo-Christian-morality governments.

It is possible that the locations of such havens will have to be kept
secret. Or constantly changed. Still, the "institution" itself would exist.
Doctors might consult for it, be paid in digital cash (or into their Swiss
